 aps\, monsters\, and a rules system specifically designed to test friendshi
 ps\, morals\, and one’s ability not to scream under pressure. They were s
 elected because they are professionals at handling silence\, bombing gracef
 ully\, and masking panic with humor. None of those skills will help them he
 re. The audience will experience…\n\nCrunchy\, cinematic combat that esca
 lates far beyond reason\n\nCharacters that begin confident and end… dubio
 us.\n\nAn omnipresent game master providing helpful guidance\, passive-aggr
 essive commentary\, and occasional emotional damage\n\nCharacters who die f
